{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号白色标题首先入眼；随后下方大号白字及紫色强调短语抢占注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他很喜欢和对方待在一起，渴望得到对方关于这份亲近以后不会改变的保证。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"开心、依恋，同时不安、害怕失去。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他具体害怕自己的需要给对方造成负担，也害怕对方有一天不再需要自己；想把心意收回去，却发现这样反而更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方标题和下方大号强调段都很显眼，主视线会在两块之间分流。\",\n    \"下方紫色放大的问句本身不能完整说明处境，需要看周围白字才能知道具体在担心什么。\",\n    \"下方段落较长，包含害怕、克制心意和无法克制真心等多层意思，快速扫读难以全部拿到。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e4bd1441-e452-4d2b-af35-909bd0d8cb7c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011840296204Z", "elapsed_seconds": 49.218, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:19:29.518838+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4d657def59f1d28199665528233612eccba5dc5402dfd78f7b92fefde4e8a557", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\